cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use MetaSpici in research, please cite this software using these metadata and identify the exact release or commit used."
title: "MetaSpici"
version: "1.1"
type: software
abstract: "MetaSpici is research software for filtering nonspecific inter-genome proximity-ligation contacts using an abundance-aware random-collision background model and observed-to-expected signal assessment."
